#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1453 expect=skipped domain=DI
#note "FRESH. No DISEQ column declared. The rule declares Requirements.Variables.All [DISEQ], so an absent DISEQ yields SKIPPED naming the variable, rather than the silent regroup EC-53 / Fix #143 would otherwise produce for an absent is_unique_set TARGET. This scenario is the reason that Requirements.Variables entry exists and nothing in the tree pinned it before."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DI
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col SPDEVID  type=Char
col DIPARMCD type=Char
col DIPARM   type=Char
col DIVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | DI | DEV-1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type  | PUMP
S1 | DI | DEV-1 | MANUF   | Manufacturer | ACME
